Moves:

X/Y/Z       - Recovery Roll (At the end of a fall)

F + Z       - Double Palm Strike
DF + Z      - Roll
(Air) D + Z - Boob Splash

X+Y         - Throw
F/B + X+Y   - Spin Throw
(Air) X+Y   - Air Throw

Y+Z         - Reflector

QCF + X/Y/Z - Command Throw
QCB + X     - Anti Air Counter
QCB + Y     - High Counter
QCB + Z     - Low Counter
D,D + X/Y/Z - Anti-Air Throw

QCB + Y+Z   - Super Counter  (One Stock)
D,D + Y+Z   - Anti-Air Super (One Stock)

QCF + Y+Z   - Super Throw    (One Stock)
> D,D + Y+Z - Followup       (One Stock)
>> X+Y+Z(B) - JUSTICE        (One Stock)


